title: Proxmox Mail Gateway: Attachment Quarantine Queue
agents: pmg
catalog: app/pmg
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the current backlog of mail quarantined for blocked attachment
 types that still needs to be released or deleted, via
 {/quarantine/attachment} with an explicit {starttime}/{endtime} window
 (the lookback in days is configurable in the special agent rule,
 default 30 days).

 Default WARN/CRIT thresholds: WARN above 1 mail, CRIT above 10 mails.

item:
 None, one service per host.

discovery:
 One service is created if the attachment quarantine queue is available
 from the API.
